    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my stomach has been feeling kinda weird since this afternoon. it started as a dull ache right around my belly button, but now it feels like it's moved down a bit more to the right side. i think it might just be a bad case of gas or something i ate. is it okay if i just take some advil and try to sleep it off? i really don't want to deal with an ER visit if i don't have to.",
